{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/extras/4a043ecb8cfe1f88779bbdd98e1b246a.poster.avif?t=1752574607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/extras/4a043ecb8cfe1f88779bbdd98e1b246a.webm?t=1752574607\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/extras/4a043ecb8cfe1f88779bbdd98e1b246a.mp4?t=1752574607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rejoice humans! The most watched Fame Show Arena Roguelike on the interdimensional cable is here. Show off your build crafting creativity, please the Gods to earn their ungodly powers and fight your way up to Stardom in this cartoony killfest for consenting adults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">'Cause you're no longer just a fighter, <strong>you're a Star.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.poster.avif?t=1752574607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.webm?t=1752574607\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/extras/fe45cbda4861121ac4023eacd9b9f817.mp4?t=1752574607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This playable demo presents the game\u2019s core loop both in single and multiplayer, with a first iteration of In Run and Permanent Progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEMO FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>2 Player Modes</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo:</strong> Single-Player. Core game combat loop, multi-run narrative and unlockable weapons, events and enemies, one character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Duo:</strong> Multi-Player, co-op 2 players. Same game loop as single player with updated narrative and an exclusive TV Event.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>TV event</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BodyCount VS (Co-Opetitive Event):</strong> Compete against a colleague, friend or foe in a multiplayer event within the run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>2 playstyles</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One playable character, Leetah with 2 playstyles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Melee and Ranged:</strong> With 4 Signature weapons with attack modes to unlock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>God\u2019s Gift</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Special abilities granted by the Gods.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kukiji Gift - Smol Frens:</strong> Imaginary friends you can use to charm enemies into fighting on your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pinn Gift - Ravening:</strong> Cross the veil, become invisible and prey on your victims!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Enemies</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 enemy + 2 Hazards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Game Progression</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First iteration of basic Roguelike systems. Added placeholder content to showcase system capabilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In Run:</strong> Power Up based build creation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Permanent:</strong> Gameplay unlocks &amp; reactive narrative between runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.poster.avif?t=1752574607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.webm?t=1752574607\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/extras/28ace8d8c6bd7e3144d24a3734cfc37b.mp4?t=1752574607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673170?t=1752574607","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673170?t=1752574607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/332b528e1296d3244cc19c3c0434048f400eddc9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752574607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/332b528e1296d3244cc19c3c0434048f400eddc9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752574607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>FOLLOW US ON KICKSTARTER</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673170/extras/b96a5fbc11c846e04d26f6ba94bb814e.poster.avif?t=1752574607\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st